WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.432 --> 00:00:03.749
Unit twenty-one. Water, Sanitation and Hygiene!

2
00:00:04.678 --> 00:00:08.196
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.246 --> 00:00:11.602
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.652 --> 00:00:15.903
Today we learn about Water, Sanitation and Hygiene. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.243
WASH. Say it with me. WASH!

6
00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:27.018
Clean water. Say it with me. Clean water!

7
00:00:30.609 --> 00:00:34.159
Sanitation. Say it with me. Sanitation!

8
00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:41.271
Handwashing. Say it with me. Handwashing!

9
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:48.020
Diarrhea. Say it with me. Diarrhea!

10
00:00:51.481 --> 00:00:55.131
Toilets. Say it with me. Toilets!

11
00:00:58.663 --> 00:01:01.863
Waste. Say it with me. Waste!

12
00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:08.683
Community. Say it with me. Community!

13
00:01:12.222 --> 00:01:22.541
WASH stands for water, sanitation, and hygiene. Clean water, safe toilets, handwashing, and good waste disposal prevent diarrhea and other diseases in the community.

14
00:01:22.591 --> 00:01:25.117
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.855 --> 00:01:30.960
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:32.160
Sanitation!

17
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:38.149
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.199 --> 00:01:39.317
Waste!

19
00:01:40.031 --> 00:01:47.717
Did you know? Unsafe water and poor sanitation are major causes of diarrhoea, which is a leading cause of death for young children worldwide!

20
00:01:47.767 --> 00:01:49.712
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.072 --> 00:01:57.815
Think and answer. What does WASH stand for?

22
00:01:57.865 --> 00:01:59.015
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.123 --> 00:02:04.497
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.547 --> 00:02:06.999
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

